D4RK OS ConfigCenter

NothingnessN — Creator and developer
1yigito — Developer; wallpapers and designs

This source bundle adapts Havoc-OS ConfigCenter for a Settings-hosted Android 13
interface. It includes work from the Android Open Source Project, CyanogenMod,
LineageOS, Havoc-OS, and PixelExperience. Original copyright and Apache License
notices are retained in the adapted source and resource files.

D4RK logo artwork was supplied by the project owner. The About-phone logo patch
retains the original Settings drawable's copyright and license header.
